-* From a string::
+* From a string (a Unicode string in Python 2)::
 
     >>> semver.VersionInfo.parse("3.4.5-pre.2+build.4")
     VersionInfo(major=3, minor=4, patch=5, prerelease='pre.2', build='build.4')
+    >>> semver.VersionInfo.parse(u"5.3.1")
